<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Holderbank raised at Salomon.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Holderbank raised at Salomon.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss building materials group Holderbank Fianciere Glaris Ltd was raised to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;underperform&quot; at Salomon Brothers, the brokerage said on Monday.</p>
<p>Salomon said the stock was at a 25 percent discount to its sum-of-parts valuation.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
